{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99634","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99634/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99634/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99634/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99634","id":2687966515,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6C8WUv","number":99634,"title":"Add `flipped_horizontally` and `flipped_vertically` signals for `Sprite2D`, `AnimatedSprite2D` and `SpriteBase3D`","user":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","color":"4466ff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-11-24T16:25:31Z","updated_at":"2024-11-27T03:12:14Z","closed_at":"2024-11-26T08:28:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99634","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99634","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99634.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99634.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Completes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5146\r\n\r\nIn that proposal, the author noted mentioned the following:\r\n> Implement a AnimatedSprite.frame_refreshed signal. Although the signal is reasonably self-explanatory, It will be emitted only once per frame, if one of the following happen:\r\n>\r\n>    The animation changes;\r\n>    The frame changes;\r\n>    flip_x and flip_y are toggled;\r\n>    The SpriteFrames frames is changed;\r\n\r\nAccording to the reference, the `frame_refreshed` will be emitted on the change of `flip_*`. But sadly, the signal was obsolescent.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, there has been a lot of discussions and proposal duplicates about complaining getting unexpected result from a scale like (-1, 1) and the users wanted to figure out a way to the solution and put their hope on `flip_*`. Because we don't have `property_changed` signal for `Object`, which could be costly for the  performance, I implemented a pair of signals for some nodes such as `Sprite2D`, `AnimatedSprite2D` and `SpriteBase3D` that have members beginning with `flip_`, which will be emitted on the change of these members.\r\n\r\nBy connecting this signal to other sprites, one can easily achieve the flipping synchronization and safe reflection on single axis (negative X/Y scale without polluting the global rotation):\r\n```GDScript\r\n# Taking a Sprite2D as an example\r\nextends Sprite2D\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n    (get_parent() as Sprite2D).flipped_horizontally.connected(\r\n        func _on_parent_flipped_horizontally(flipped: bool) -> void:\r\n            if flip_h == flipped:\r\n               return\r\n            flip_h = flipped\r\n            position.x *= -1.0\r\n    )\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99634/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99634/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}